{"id":"865d91735afbcff2","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-enumerationtime.md","title":"总输出、增量与延迟复杂度","display":"df-enumerationtime — 总输出、增量与延迟复杂度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-enumerationtime","aliases":["27-df-enumerationtime"],"display":"df-enumerationtime — 总输出、增量与延迟复杂度","depends_on":["[[27-df-enumerationproblem]]","[[27-df-turing-machine]]","[[27-df-tm-runtime]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix B.8","source_printed_pages":"625–626","source_pdf_pages":"649–650","verification_status":"source-checked-with-explicit-termination-refinement"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-enumerationtime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-enumerationtime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-enumerationtime — 总输出、增量与延迟复杂度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4de10af6b469ac9\" href=\"?note=f4de10af6b469ac9\" title=\"27-df-enumerationproblem\">27-df-enumerationproblem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix B.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"625–626"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"649–650"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-checked-with-explicit-termination-refinement"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa,S_D,m_D\">\\(D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa,S_D,m_D\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4de10af6b469ac9\" href=\"?note=f4de10af6b469ac9\" title=\"27-df-enumerationproblem\">27-df-enumerationproblem</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Run}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Run}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Time}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a>。下式将枚举器编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\">\\(A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为现有确定型机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 为该机器指定的非初始、非停机输出状态。输出事件、合法枚举器集合、输出时刻与复杂度谓词均由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> 沿用上述非负系数多项式集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pref}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\tau(j))\\mid j\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ j&lt;\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N^+\\mid\\tau(i)=2\\}\\}\\quad(\\tau\\in\\mathcal U),\\qquad\\mathrm{Pref}:\\mathcal U\\to\\mathbb B^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pref}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\tau(j))\\mid j\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ j&lt;\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N^+\\mid\\tau(i)=2\\}\\}\\quad(\\tau\\in\\mathcal U),\\qquad\\mathrm{Pref}:\\mathcal U\\to\\mathbb B^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M,o\\rangle\\mid M=(Q,\\delta)\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ o\\in Q\\setminus\\{0,1,2\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M,o\\rangle\\mid M=(Q,\\delta)\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ o\\in Q\\setminus\\{0,1,2\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Time}_M(\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w))\\quad(A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\\in\\mathcal E,\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Time}_M(\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w))\\quad(A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\\in\\mathcal E,\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\{(t,\\mathrm{Pref}(\\tau))\\mid t\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\tau\\in\\mathcal U,\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Run}_M(\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w),t,(o,\\tau,h))\\}\n\\quad(A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\\in\\mathcal E,\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\{(t,\\mathrm{Pref}(\\tau))\\mid t\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\tau\\in\\mathcal U,\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Run}_M(\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w),t,(o,\\tau,h))\\}\n\\quad(A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\\in\\mathcal E,\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\{u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(t,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\}\n=\\{\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\mid v\\in S_D(w)\\}\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;\n\\left(((s,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\land(t,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w))\\Rightarrow s=t\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\{u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(t,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\}\n=\\{\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\mid v\\in S_D(w)\\}\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;\n\\left(((s,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\land(t,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w))\\Rightarrow s=t\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,0)\\coloneqq0\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,0)\\coloneqq0\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N\\mid|\\{(s,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\mid s\\le t\\}|=k\\}\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ k\\in[m_D(w)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N\\mid|\\{(s,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\mid s\\le t\\}|=k\\}\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ k\\in[m_D(w)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\nh_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\le p(|w|+m_D(w)+1)\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TotalPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\nh_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\le p(|w|+m_D(w)+1)\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\le p(|w|+m_D(w)+1)\\land\n\\forall k\\in[m_D(w)]\\;\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)\\le p(|w|+k+1)\\right)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\le p(|w|+m_D(w)+1)\\land\n\\forall k\\in[m_D(w)]\\;\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)\\le p(|w|+k+1)\\right)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DelayPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left((\\forall k\\in[m_D(w)]\\;\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)-\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k-1)\\le p(|w|+1))\\land\nh_{A,\\kappa}(w)-\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,m_D(w))\\le p(|w|+1)\\right)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DelayPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left((\\forall k\\in[m_D(w)]\\;\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)-\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k-1)\\le p(|w|+1))\\land\nh_{A,\\kappa}(w)-\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,m_D(w))\\le p(|w|+1)\\right)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限支持保证正带格中存在首个空白，所以 Pref 是唯一有限二进制字串；首格为空白时它就是空字串。指定输出状态属于机器本身的状态集，不要求所有已有机器含某个固定编号。机器进入该状态即记录一次当前字串，随后仍按原转移关系继续；负带格及首空白后的区域可保留输入和工作数据。Trace 的像集等式要求所有且仅有正确编码输出，重复禁止条件要求每个输出只出现一次，有限停机时间明确要求枚举完成后终止。于是第 k 次输出时刻的最小值存在。</p>\n<p>无解输入的 Trace 为空、m=0，三个界仍检验从开始到停机的全部时间；有解输入也计入末次输出后的尾部时间。此处是对原复杂度接口的本地机器实现，使用目录已有单带确定型模型。单次输出观察不会提供超出计算时间的无界信息：有限步可写出的带内容长度受输入长度与步数约束；复制与读取这些输出只产生多项式模拟开销。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-enumerationproblem","status":"resolved","id":"f4de10af6b469ac9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-enumerationproblem]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"a31024701b006c36","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-tm-runtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-enumerationproblem","status":"resolved","id":"f4de10af6b469ac9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{en