le M,o\\rangle\\mid M=(Q,\\delta)\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ o\\in Q\\setminus\\{0,1,2\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Time}_M(\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w))\\quad(A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\\in\\mathcal E,\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\{(t,\\mathrm{Pref}(\\tau))\\mid t\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\tau\\in\\mathcal U,\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Run}_M(\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w),t,(o,\\tau,h))\\}\n\\quad(A=\\langle M,o\\rangle\\in\\mathcal E,\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\{u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(t,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\}\n=\\{\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\mid v\\in S_D(w)\\}\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;\n\\left(((s,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\land(t,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w))\\Rightarrow s=t\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,0)\\coloneqq0\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N\\mid|\\{(s,u)\\in\\mathrm{Trace}_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\mid s\\le t\\}|=k\\}\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ k\\in[m_D(w)]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\nh_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\le p(|w|+m_D(w)+1)\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(h_{A,\\kappa}(w)\\le p(|w|+m_D(w)+1)\\land\n\\forall k\\in[m_D(w)]\\;\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)\\le p(|w|+k+1)\\right)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DelayPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left((\\forall k\\in[m_D(w)]\\;\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k)-\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,k-1)\\le p(|w|+1))\\land\nh_{A,\\kappa}(w)-\\tau_{A,\\kappa}(w,m_D(w))\\le p(|w|+1)\\right)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}).","display":true}],"bytes":4408,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-enumerationtime|df-enumerationtime — 总输出、增量与延迟复杂度]]"},{"id":"a700eb7e844ad3ee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Next}_D,\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationproblem]]；$\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}$、$\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationtime]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Output}_N$、$\\mathrm{Time}_N$ 使用该定义的本目录上游接口。合法 NEXT 机器集合 $\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}$ 与运行时间 $T_{N,\\kappa}$ 由下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["f4de10af6b469ac9","a31024701b006c36","fe90a43e6765ed55"]}